[h2]Build 0.9.18[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]SKÅPKÖK wall cabinets[/b]: select a cabinet, sink or hob and toggle "Wall cabinets" to hang a row of cupboards above it. Neighbouring fitted counters join into one run, and they butt up neatly against tall units.
[*][b]SKÅPKÖK hutch[/b]: a counter with open plate shelving above. Joins the kitchen run and holds three stacks.
[*][b]SKÅPKÖK wall oven[/b]: a tall built-in oven tower. Cooks everything an electric stove cooks, a little faster than the hob.
[*][b]SKÅPKÖK fridge[/b]: a tall built-in fridge with a freezer drawer. Stores food, and while it has power, nothing kept in it rots.
[*][b]Dubs Bad Hygiene support[/b]: with Dubs Bad Hygiene installed, the SKÅPKÖK sink plumbs into the sewage system and keeps the kitchen cleaner, which makes meals cooked there safer.
[/list]
[h3]Changed[/h3]
[list]
[*]Kitchen units, shelving, bookcases, wardrobes and benches now sit flush against walls instead of leaving a gap, both at the ends of a run and along the back.
[*]A cleaner kitchen means safer food: the sink's cleanliness counts toward the room's food poisoning chance.
[/list]
